      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "HOW IT SCORES",
      "narration_text": "Here's how it scores. Seven words that come easily: cat, dog, horse, cow, sheep, pig, goat. The official scorer gives that forty-two. Seven far apart: volcano, spoon, justice, violin, glacier, receipt, tiger. Eighty-seven. All it measures is how far apart your words sit in a map of meaning.",
